!   Frequently Asked Questions
## FAQ


  This page contains frequently asked questions submitted to JASSPA over the
  years. Some of the older entries refer to platforms and tools that are no
  longer supported (MS-DOS, Windows 3.x, old DOS/Windows shells and helpers);
  they are kept here for historical reference. The questions most relevant to
  the current releases are the later ones (roughly faq44 onwards) and the
  encoding questions faq48 and faq49.

  [FAQs](FAQs(0f)) - FAQ Contact information  
